  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;domain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;domain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;domain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;domain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;domain&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p><p>So, common domain is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
